<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Wenno</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. 1209</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Wenno was the first master of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/livonian-brothers-of-the-sword">Livonian Brothers of the Sword</a>, the crusading order founded in 1202 to conquer and convert <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/livonia">Livonia</a>. He led its early campaigns against the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/livonians">Livs</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/latgalians">Latgalians</a> from Riga. In 1209 he was murdered by one of the order's own brothers, Wickbert, and was succeeded by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/volquin">Volquin</a>.</p></div>
